    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051108.0331\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 9 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: Six-party talks begins in Beijing\n\n\n\n\nThe fifth round of the six-party talks on the Korean Peninsula nuclear issue began at 10:00 a.m. Wednesday at Beijing's Diaoyutai State Guesthouse.\n\nThe talks involves China, the Democratic People's Republic of Korea, the United States, Republic of Korea, Russia and Japan.",
